{"pagination":{"count":10,"page":1,"next_page":2,"total_count":1000,"total_pages":100},"records":[{"platform":"desktop","title":"Cron Calendar","url":"https://cron.com","uuid":"0528b40d-d5ef-4783-9206-d42fa97ad1d2","preview_url":"https://images.refero.design/styles/cron.com/0528b40d-d5ef-4783-9206-d42fa97ad1d2/preview_0.jpg","description":"A stark, minimal dark-mode landing page with a refined cockpit-like feel. The palette is dominated by near-black and deep graphite surfaces, lifted by crisp white typography and a single vivid orange accent used sparingly for the logo, primary action, and tiny highlights. The layout is clean and centered, with a simple top navigation bar, generous vertical spacing, and a strong hero hierarchy that places an oversized bold headline above smaller supporting text. A compact announcement pill sits above the main message, adding a subtle layered detail without disrupting the restraint of the composition. The overall typography feels sharp and modern, using a Helvetica Neue-style sans serif with strong weight contrast between the display headline and lighter body text. Buttons are compact, rectangular, and precise, with low-radius corners and minimal decoration, while the product screenshot below is presented as a flat, contained rectangle that reinforces the utilitarian, professional identity. The visual language is polished, direct, and highly legible, with subtle glow-like warmth around orange elements and an otherwise flat, high-contrast dark surface treatment."},{"platform":"desktop","title":"Krea","url":"https://krea.ai","uuid":"3a63b3fa-dc79-4dc3-935e-3f8f4ab447a7","preview_url":"https://images.refero.design/styles/krea.ai/3a63b3fa-dc79-4dc3-935e-3f8f4ab447a7/preview_0.jpg","description":"A moody, high-contrast dark landing page with a restrained terminal-like luxury. The entire interface is built around near-black surfaces, luminous white typography, and very subtle gray separations, creating a crisp midnight command-center feel. The visual hierarchy is clean and centered, with a classic top navigation bar, generous breathing room, and a large hero composition that dominates the screen. Typography is modern, geometric, and confident, with a large display headline in tight spacing and smaller supporting text in soft gray for a precise, editorial tone.

The page combines atmospheric photography with product mockups: a dark, cinematic background scene anchors the hero, while the central monitor screenshot adds realism and product clarity. Buttons are minimal and polished, using rounded pill and rounded-rectangle forms with white and charcoal fills, giving the interface a calm, premium SaaS feel rather than a flashy startup aesthetic. Borders, shadows, and gradients are extremely subtle, used only to separate layers and add depth. Overall the design feels sleek, focused, and quietly futuristic, with a strong monochrome palette, balanced spacing, and a refined, high-end software brand presence."},{"platform":"desktop","title":"Elementor","url":"https://elementor.com","uuid":"86351665-7483-48d1-9be4-5fe456093686","preview_url":"https://images.refero.design/styles/elementor.com/86351665-7483-48d1-9be4-5fe456093686/preview_0.jpg","description":"A stark monochrome, premium SaaS landing-page aesthetic built almost entirely on black, white, and soft off-white. The visual identity feels high-contrast and editorial, with a press-like seriousness where bold typography carries the design instead of color. The hero uses a full-bleed moody lifestyle photograph with large, tightly set white headline text layered over the image, creating a dramatic, poster-like opening. Type is heavy, compressed, and confident, with oversized weight-900 display styling and compact spacing that gives the layout a stamped, ink-on-paper feel. The top navigation is clean and restrained, set in a rounded white bar with minimal black text links and a single strong black call-to-action button. Surfaces alternate between pure black and bright white or soft foggy white, producing a checkerboard rhythm across the page. Cards are simple and geometric with generous padding, rounded corners, and no visible shadows, relying on surface inversion rather than elevation for hierarchy. Buttons are similarly minimal, with black-filled primary actions and white secondary actions, both sharply defined and highly legible. Supporting text appears in muted gray, while icons and dividers stay thin and understated. Overall, the look is polished, modern, and highly structured — a minimalist enterprise-SaaS style with an editorial edge and a strong sense of contrast, space, and typographic authority."},{"platform":"desktop","title":"Superlative","url":"https://playsuperlative.com","uuid":"4ee42a45-82e7-4a4b-8cc3-86c6b77bbca4","preview_url":"https://images.refero.design/styles/playsuperlative.com/4ee42a45-82e7-4a4b-8cc3-86c6b77bbca4/preview_0.jpg","description":"A stark, precision-driven dark interface with a cinematic product-photography hero. The whole screen feels like a high-end electronic instrument or design-studio landing presentation: matte black and deep charcoal surfaces, thin white typography, and sparse orange indicator lights that read as functional rather than decorative. The layout is full-bleed and immersive, with oversized angled product imagery dominating the composition and text layered directly over it. Headings are tall, condensed, and uppercase, giving the design an engineered, industrial tone. Navigation and metadata are minimal, tucked into corners and edges with plenty of negative space. Buttons and labels are restrained, using ghost outlines, fine borders, and compact proportions. The overall mood is technical, premium, and disciplined, with a flat, high-contrast finish and very little visual noise."},{"platform":"desktop","title":"SST","url":"https://sst.dev","uuid":"7b6c53c7-7145-476e-aed8-f2367eef3adb","preview_url":"https://images.refero.design/styles/sst.dev/7b6c53c7-7145-476e-aed8-f2367eef3adb/preview_0.jpg","description":"A clean, airy developer-tool landing page with a minimalist editorial feel. The whole interface sits on a bright white canvas with very soft gray dividers, faint shadows, and lots of breathing room, giving it the look of a carefully typeset technical document rather than a flashy marketing site. Typography does most of the work: a large, bold monospaced hero headline anchors the right side, while the rest of the copy uses a compact sans serif with restrained weight and subtle gray-violet tones. The visual balance is split between a code editor card on the left and the messaging column on the right, creating a calm, centered composition with strong hierarchy and generous spacing. The code block is the main visual motif, presented in a neat rounded card with light elevation and multicolor syntax highlighting in muted rose, violet, blue, indigo, and teal. Navigation and utility controls are tiny, crisp, and understated, using pill-like buttons, thin borders, and low-contrast text. Overall, the style feels precise, modern, and technical, with a polished Scandinavian-like restraint and a blueprint-inspired clarity."},{"platform":"desktop","title":"Desktop.fm","url":"https://desktop.fm","uuid":"5b70f172-2ba2-4f26-9956-251d4cfc0329","preview_url":"https://images.refero.design/styles/desktop.fm/5b70f172-2ba2-4f26-9956-251d4cfc0329/preview_0.jpg","description":"A clean, minimal operating-system-inspired landing screen with a light Cloud Cover gray field and a single centered hero composition. The mood is quiet, functional, and digitally precise, with strong restraint in color and layout. The main visual is a glossy reflective CD rendered like a futuristic object, floating above the interface and crossed by thin neon-green light streaks that add motion and a sci-fi accent without overwhelming the neutral palette. Below it sits a small floating card with soft 25px rounding, subtle elevation, and a polished glassy-neutral feel. Typography is compact, bold, and highly legible, using dark graphite text with tight system-style spacing. Controls are sparse and utilitarian: rounded dark slate primary button, tiny circular utility icons, and a few muted gray accents. Overall it feels like a minimalist desktop utility or experimental digital product, blending monochrome surfaces, understated shadows, precise alignment, and a single vivid green highlight into a crisp, modern, high-fidelity interface."},{"platform":"desktop","title":"Phantom Studios","url":"https://www.phantom.land","uuid":"57173e45-09c8-4278-9024-a634e97bacda","preview_url":"https://images.refero.design/styles/www.phantom.land/57173e45-09c8-4278-9024-a634e97bacda/preview_0.jpg","description":"A stark, ultra-minimal dark studio landing aesthetic with a pure black full-bleed background and almost no ornament. The composition is extremely sparse and centered, giving the screen a quiet, cinematic emptiness with strong negative space. Typography is the main visual event: small crisp white sans-serif text sits in the middle with a restrained, refined presence, while the overall hierarchy feels subtle and tightly controlled. A thin neon green line along the bottom edge provides the only vivid accent, introducing a precise technical shimmer against the monochrome field. The design feels flat and disciplined, with no visible shadows, gradients, or layered surfaces—just clean type, hairline geometry, and a highly focused creative-agency mood that reads as modern, high-end, and digitally exact."},{"platform":"desktop","title":"Changelog","url":"https://linear.app/changelog","uuid":"11d3e58a-87d7-4a9a-bbf5-720f4fd3ffc6","preview_url":"https://images.refero.design/styles/linear.app/11d3e58a-87d7-4a9a-bbf5-720f4fd3ffc6/preview_0.jpg","description":"A dark, highly restrained devtools-style changelog layout with the polished atmosphere of a midnight command center behind frosted glass. The whole interface sits on an almost-black canvas with subtle grayscale layering and barely-there elevation, using borders and tonal shifts instead of shadows to create depth. Typography is the main visual hero: crisp Inter-driven text in a compact, disciplined hierarchy, with large headlines set in a refined medium weight rather than bold, giving the page an authoritative but understated feel. The top navigation is slim and low-prominence, with small text links and a soft pill-shaped sign-up button that stands out through its light fill rather than bright color.

The page structure feels centered, contained, and editorially organized, with generous vertical breathing room and a text-first rhythm. Changelog entries are presented as clean dark cards and stacked sections, each separated by thin graphite borders and modest 8px rounding. Monochrome icon clusters and contained product graphics act as functional focal points, adding a technical, product-aware layer without breaking the minimal mood. Search, tabs, and pills are all rounded to a 9999px capsule form, reinforcing the contrast between soft interactive elements and the strict, architectural framing of the content. Overall the style is quiet, precise, premium, and focused, with a deliberate monochrome palette and a subtle futuristic tone."},{"platform":"desktop","title":"Rive","url":"https://rive.app","uuid":"56600540-1e52-49c6-b16a-b382acf048f2","preview_url":"https://images.refero.design/styles/rive.app/56600540-1e52-49c6-b16a-b382acf048f2/preview_0.jpg","description":"A stark, dark-mode creative software aesthetic with a precision-engineered, futuristic feel. The entire interface sits on a pure black canvas, with deep charcoal and graphite surfaces creating subtle layered depth instead of shadows. Typography is the main visual signature: tall, wide-set, technical sans-serif headings in crisp white, paired with smaller muted gray supporting text that keeps the hierarchy clean and focused. Navigation is minimal and restrained, running in a thin top bar with understated links and a compact warm accent button at the far right. The centerpiece hero section is highly centered and spacious, with a large uppercase headline, short supporting copy, and a pair of compact action buttons below, one using a single orange-gold accent that stands out sharply against the monochrome environment. Lower sections use a grid of dark rectangular category cards with thin borders and subdued labels, reinforcing a modular, blueprint-like layout. Overall it feels polished, minimal, and technically exact—part enterprise tool, part high-end motion/design platform, with a disciplined color palette and a quiet but premium sense of control."},{"platform":"desktop","title":"Handhold","url":"https://handhold.io","uuid":"da999138-8b32-4c82-8df7-f6d239c01f2f","preview_url":"https://images.refero.design/styles/handhold.io/da999138-8b32-4c82-8df7-f6d239c01f2f/preview_0.jpg","description":"A calm, high-contrast AI brand landing page with a very spacious white canvas and a refined editorial feel. The whole composition is centered and minimal, with a quiet luxury mood built from restraint: large serif headline typography, lots of breathing room, and very little visual noise. The typography is the main event, with an elegant, lightly weighted serif for the hero headline and clean sans-serif supporting text that keeps everything crisp and readable. Interaction is expressed through stark black pill buttons with white text, giving the interface a controlled, confident presence. The top navigation is slim and understated, with small utility links aligned to the right and a compact logo lockup on the left. Visual interest comes from a soft abstract ribbon or wave motif in pale blue and warm yellow, stretched horizontally across the lower hero like a gentle atmospheric accent. Beneath it, a row of monochrome client logos adds credibility without disrupting the minimal layout. Overall the design feels polished, airy, and precise, mixing startup clarity with an editorial, almost gallery-like softness."}]}
